Tank = INTEG(Delivery - Use, 100) ~ MB ~ thousand barrels |
Delivery = 5000 ~ barrel/Day ~ written in barrels |
Use = Tank * Use Fraction ~ MB/Day ~ |
Use Fraction = 5 ~ %/Day ~ meant as 5 percent |
Power = 100 ~ MW ~ |
Energy = INTEG(Power, 0) ~ kWh ~ |
INITIAL TIME = 0 ~ Day ~ | FINAL TIME = 10 ~ Day ~ | TIME STEP = 1 ~ Day ~ | SAVEPER = 1 ~ Day ~ |
